[36.384957, "o", "ne' = None, extra_query: 'Query | None' = None, extra_body: 'Body | None' = None) -> 'JobGetResultsResponse' method of llama_cloud.resources.classifier.classifi\r\n"]
[36.384987, "o", "er.ClassifierResource instance\r\n"]
[36.385052, "o", "    Create a classify job and wait for it to complete, returning the results.\r\n\r\n"]
[36.385099, "o", "    This is a convenience method that combines create(), wait_for_completion(),\r\n    and get_results() into a single call for the most common end-to-end workflow.\r\n\r\n"]
[36.385144, "o", "    Args:\r\n        file_ids: The IDs of the files to classify\r\n\r\n"]
[36.385211, "o", "        rules: The rules to classify the files\r\n\r\n"]
[36.385266, "o", "        mode: The classification mode to use (\"FAST\" or \"MULTIMODAL\")\r\n\r\n        organization_id: Optional organization ID\r\n\r\n"]
[36.385296, "o", "        project_id: Optional project ID\r\n\r\n"]
[36.385321, "o", "        parsing_configuration: The configuration for the parsing job\r\n\r\n"]
[36.385433, "o", "        polling_interval: Initial polling interval in seconds (default: 1.0)\r\n\r\n        max_interval: Maximum polling interval for backoff in seconds (default: 5.0)\r\n\r\n"]
[36.385482, "o", "        timeout: Maximum time to wait in seconds (default: 300.0)\r\n\r\n"]
[36.38553, "o", "        backoff: Backoff strategy for polling intervals. Options:\r\n"]
[36.385576, "o", "            - \"constant\": Keep the same polling interval\r\n"]
[36.385631, "o", "            - \"linear\": Increase interval by 1 second each poll (default)\r\n"]
[36.385666, "o", "            - \"exponential\": Double the interval each poll\r\n\r\n"]
[36.385699, "o", "        verbose: Print progress indicators every 10 polls (default: False)\r\n\r\n\u001b[7m--More--\u001b[27m"]
